<view class="photo-editor"><button class="details-toggle" bindtap="toggle" aria-expanded="{{open}}"><view><text class="details-title">摄影参数 · 可选</text><text class="details-note">补充相机、镜头与拍摄设置</text></view><view class="details-chevron {{open ? 'opened' : ''}}"/></button><view wx:if="{{open}}" class="details-fields"><text class="details-policy">仅填写你知道的参数，随帖子公开并标为「作者填写」。照片自带的参数会单独显示。</text><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="details-field"><text>{{item.label}}</text><input value="{{value[item.key] || ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" maxlength="80" bindinput="change" placeholder="{{item.placeholder}}"/></view></view></view>
